OL,3,GNEWSANew 'fun zone' play areas to be
OL,4,Abuilt in 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo new play parks are set to be built
OL,7,Fin Derbyshire in 2027, with locals
OL,8,Fgiven the chance to pick the new
OL,9,Fdesigns.
OL,11,FErewash Borough Council said the two
OL,12,Fnew "fun zone" play areas would be
OL,13,Fbuilt in Kirk Hallam and at Ilkeston's
OL,14,FVictoria Park in the new scheme.
OL,16,FThe former location is set to be a
OL,17,F"destination adventureland" that pays
OL,18,Ftribute to the legendary Anglo-Saxon
OL,19,Fchieftain who was said to have founded
OL,20,FIlkeston, the council said.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
