OL,3,GNEWSANew 'fun zone' play areas to be
OL,4,Abuilt in 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FBoth parks will be funded through the
OL,7,FErewash Investment Fund, set up by the
OL,8,Fcouncil to support local projects.
